OL,3,GNEWSATrain staff strike over East West
OL,4,ARail train door row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first trains on a #7bn new railway
OL,7,Fwhich will eventually connect Oxford
OL,8,Fand Cambridge could be further delayed
OL,9,Fdue to industrial action.
OL,11,FThe National Union of Rail, Maritime
OL,12,Fand Transport Workers (RMT), which
OL,13,Frepresents train guards, said on
OL,14,FTuesday that its Chiltern Railways
OL,15,Fmembers had agreed to take 24-hour
OL,16,Fstrike action.
OL,18,FIt comes following a lengthy dispute
OL,19,Fover plans for drivers to control the
OL,20,Fopening and closing of carriage doors
OL,21,Fon services along the first section of
OL,22,Fthe new East West Rail (EWR) route.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
