OL,3,GNEWSATrain staff strike over East West
OL,4,ARail train door row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted the Department
OL,7,Ffor Transport for a comment, but a
OL,8,Fspokesperson told The Telegraph that
OL,9,Fthe proposals were a "model approved by
OL,10,Fthe independent rail regulator".
